    "warm_decision_control": "After initial publication, the shared planner returns definite False/True for the two required candidates, and Unknown for the uncounted tail; only Unknown invokes the body reducer. Parse-dependent predicates such as tool:edit still reduce required candidate bodies on repeat; affordance counts do not cache arbitrary predicates."
